<title>UK: Burmah Castrol off after broker downgrade.</title>
<headline>Burmah Castrol off after broker downgrade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Burmah Castrol slipped in early trading on Monday after Kleinwort Benson downgraded its stance on the stock to &quot;hold&quot; from &quot;buy&quot;, market sources said.</p>
<p>By 0825 GMT the shares, which also went ex-dividend this morning, had slipped 23-1/2p to 1,143-1/2p.</p>
<p>Kleinwort Benson analysts were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8712</p>
